\label{sec:derrick-pohozaev-identity}

For $n>2$, consider
\[
\begin{cases}
-\Delta u=|u|^{p-1}u & \text{in }U,\\
u=0 & \text{on }\partial U,
\end{cases}
\tag{11}
\]
in the supercritical range
\[
\frac{n+2}{n-2}<p<\infty.
\tag{13}
\]

